msgstr "View the ballot"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:5
#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:6
msgid "Configuration du scrutin"
msgstr "Poll configuration"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:59
msgid ""
"Le scrutin est en brouillon : toute la configuration est modifiable. Elle se "
"fige à l'ouverture. Les points encore incomplets sont signalés sur le "
"tableau de bord."
msgstr ""
"The poll is in draft: the whole configuration is editable. It freezes on "
"opening. Anything still incomplete is flagged on the dashboard."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:76
#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:55
msgid "(des champs à corriger)"
msgstr "(fields to fix)"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:77
#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:56
msgid "Ce champ est obligatoire."
msgstr "This field is required."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:102
msgid ""
"Le scrutin est en brouillon. Cette configuration reste modifiable par "
"l'administrateur du scrutin ; ce rôle n'y a accès qu'en lecture."
msgstr ""
"The poll is in draft. This configuration remains editable by the poll "
"administrator; this role has read-only access to it."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:112
#, python-format
msgid "Ce scrutin a été retiré le %(when)s, motif : %(reason)s."
msgstr "This poll was withdrawn on %(when)s, reason: %(reason)s."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:116
msgid "Il n'apparaît plus sur aucune page publique."
msgstr "It no longer appears on any public page."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:130
msgid "La date de clôture ne peut plus être reportée."
msgstr "The closing date can no longer be extended."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:132
msgid ""
"Le scrutin n'est plus en brouillon : la configuration est figée. Seule la "
"date de clôture peut encore être repoussée, avec un motif."
msgstr ""
"The poll is no longer in draft: the configuration is frozen. Only the "
"closing date can still be postponed, with a reason."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:137
msgid "Titre"
msgstr "Title"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:138
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Description"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:143
msgid "Fuseau horaire"
msgstr "Timezone"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:148
msgid "Modification d'un bulletin déjà voté"
msgstr "Modification of a ballot already cast"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:148
