msgstr "permitted"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:148
msgid "interdite"
msgstr "not permitted"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:150
msgid "Participation affichée pendant le scrutin"
msgstr "Participation shown while the poll is open"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:151
msgid "Formulaire signé exigé (papier)"
msgstr "Signed form required (paper)"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:152
msgid "Contreseing exigé (papier)"
msgstr "Countersignature required (paper)"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:153
msgid "Rapprochement exigé (papier)"
msgstr "Reconciliation required (paper)"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:174
msgid ""
"Ce scrutin est annoncé : il est visible sur le site public, mais le vote "
"n'est pas encore ouvert."
msgstr ""
"This poll is announced: it is visible on the public site, but voting is not "
"yet open."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:175
msgid ""
"Le scrutin s'ouvre normalement tout seul à la date d'ouverture configurée, "
"même en retard si besoin. Vous pouvez aussi l'ouvrir maintenant vous-même, y "
"compris par avance : la date d'ouverture devient alors l'instant présent."
msgstr ""
"The poll normally opens by itself at the configured opening date, even late "
"if need be. You may also open it yourself right now, including ahead of "
"time: the opening date then becomes the present moment."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:179
msgid "Ouvrir le scrutin maintenant"
msgstr "Open the poll now"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:194
msgid ""
"Uniquement vers une date postérieure. Le report est inscrit au journal "
"d'audit et affiché sur la page publique du scrutin ; la fenêtre de saisie "
"des bulletins papier est décalée d'autant."
msgstr ""
"Only to a later date. The extension is recorded in the audit log and shown "
"on the poll's public page; the paper-entry window shifts by the same amount."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:204
msgid "Reporter la clôture"
msgstr "Postpone closing"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:211
#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_index.html:29
#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:70
#: src/templates/backoffice/role_admin.html:55
msgid "Clôture"
msgstr "Closing"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:222
msgid ""
"L'échéance de saisie des bulletins papier est atteinte : vous pouvez clore "
"le scrutin maintenant plutôt que d'attendre la prochaine exécution de la "
"tâche planifiée."
msgstr ""
"The paper-entry deadline has been reached: you may close the poll now "
"instead of waiting for the next scheduled run."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:234
msgid "Clôturer le scrutin maintenant"
msgstr "Close the poll now"

# R-3.11: withdrawal, added by hand for the same reason as the header explains.
#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:244
msgid "Retrait"
msgstr "Withdrawal"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:258
#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:270
msgid "Retirer le scrutin"
msgstr "Withdraw the poll"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_config.html:259
msgid ""
"Retire ce scrutin du site public, immédiatement et irréversiblement : plus "
"rien de lui — propositions, calendrier, participation, résultat déjà publié "
"le cas échéant — n'y reste visible. Les bulletins et le journal d'audit sont "
"conservés."
msgstr ""
"Withdraws this poll from the public site, immediately and irreversibly: "
"nothing of it — propositions, calendar, participation, an already-published "
"result where one exists — remains visible there. Ballots and the audit log "
"are kept."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:10
msgid ""
"Toute la configuration reste modifiable tant que le scrutin est en "
"brouillon ; vous n'avez pas besoin de tout renseigner ici. Une fois créé, "
"allez sur « Rôles par scrutin » pour vous attribuer un rôle : la création "
"n'en donne aucun."
msgstr ""
"The whole configuration stays editable while the poll is in draft; you do "
"not need to fill everything in here. Once created, go to “Roles per poll” to "
"grant yourself one: creating it grants none."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:14
msgid "Commencer à partir d'un modèle"
msgstr "Start from a template"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:22
msgid ""
"Reprend la méthode de dépouillement et les règles de bulletin d'un modèle "
"enregistré. L'intitulé, la description et les propositions restent à saisir."
msgstr ""
"Carries over a saved template's tally method and ballot rules. The title, "
"the description and the propositions remain to be entered."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:24
msgid "Modèle"
msgstr "Template"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:26
msgid "— scrutin vierge —"
msgstr "— blank poll —"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:31
msgid "Charger"
msgstr "Load"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_create.html:34
#, python-format
msgid "Champs pré-remplis depuis le modèle « %(name)s »."
msgstr "Fields pre-filled from the template “%(name)s”."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_index.html:6
msgid "Vos scrutins"
msgstr "Your polls"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_index.html:17
msgid ""
"Vous administrez la commune : tous les scrutins sont listés. L'accès aux "
"écrans d'un scrutin demande un rôle sur ce scrutin."
msgstr ""
"You administer the commune: every poll is listed. Reaching a poll’s screens "
"requires a role on that poll."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_index.html:18
msgid "Créer un scrutin"
msgstr "Create a poll"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_index.html:24
msgid "Scrutins sur lesquels vous avez un rôle"
msgstr "Polls on which you hold a role"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_index.html:37
#: src/templates/backoffice/role_admin.html:63
