msgstr "No poll is assigned to you."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:13
msgid ""
"Aperçu interne : cette page n'est pas publique. Le scrutin est en brouillon "
"et sa configuration peut encore changer avant l'annonce."
msgstr ""
"Internal preview: this page is not public. The poll is a draft and its "
"configuration may still change before it is announced."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:25
msgid "Partager cet aperçu"
msgstr "Share this preview"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:26
msgid ""
"Génère un lien impossible à deviner qui permet à quiconque le détient de "
"consulter cet aperçu sans compte espace mairie. Contrairement à l'annonce, "
"ce lien ne fige pas la configuration : la page peut changer d'une "
"consultation à l'autre, tout comme le projet lui-même."
msgstr ""
"Generates a link impossible to guess that lets anyone holding it view this "
"preview without an espace mairie account. Unlike announcing, this link does "
"not freeze the configuration: the page may change between two visits, "
"exactly as the draft itself may."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:28
msgid "Lien de partage"
msgstr "Share link"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:33
msgid "Régénérer le lien"
msgstr "Regenerate the link"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:38
msgid "Révoquer le lien"
msgstr "Revoke the link"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:45
msgid "Générer un lien de partage"
msgstr "Generate a share link"

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:48
msgid "Aucun lien de partage n'est actif."
msgstr "No share link is active."

#: src/templates/backoffice/poll_preview.html:56
#: src/templates/publicsite/poll_preview_shared.html:22
msgid "Brouillon — pas encore annoncé ni visible du public."
msgstr "Draft — not yet announced or visible to the public."

#: src/templates/backoffice/registration_queue.html:5
msgid "Inscriptions en attente"
msgstr "Pending registrations"

#: src/templates/backoffice/registration_queue.html:16
msgid ""
"Ces demandes n'ont pas pu être rapprochées automatiquement de la liste "
"électorale. Comparez la déclaration à la liste, puis acceptez ou refusez "
"avec un motif."
msgstr ""
"These requests could not be matched automatically against the electoral "
"roll. Compare the declaration with the roll, then accept or refuse with a "
"reason."

#: src/templates/backoffice/registration_queue.html:23
msgid ""
"Une même adresse électronique ne peut servir qu'une fois. Deux personnes "
"partageant une adresse ne peuvent pas s'inscrire toutes les deux en ligne : "
"leur voie est le vote papier à la mairie."
msgstr ""
"One email address can be used only once. Two people sharing an address "
"cannot both register online: their route is the paper ballot at the mairie."

#: src/templates/backoffice/registration_queue.html:32
msgid "Date de naissance déclarée"
msgstr "Declared date of birth"

#: src/templates/backoffice/registration_queue.html:33
msgid "non renseignée"
msgstr "not given"

#: src/templates/backoffice/registration_queue.html:36
msgid "Déclaration sur l'honneur"
msgstr "Declaration on honour"

#: src/templates/backoffice/registration_queue.html:37
