#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:5
#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:6
msgid "Clôture et publication"
msgstr "Closure and publication"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:17
msgid ""
"Le scrutin n'est pas encore clos. Le dépouillement et la publication seront "
"possibles après la clôture."
msgstr ""
"The poll is not yet closed. The tally and publication will be possible after "
"closure."

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:21
msgid "Clôture automatique"
msgstr "Automatic closure"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:25
msgid "Ce qui bloquerait la clôture"
msgstr "What would block closure"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:44
#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:95
msgid "Formulaires papier conservés"
msgstr "Paper forms retained"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:45
#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:96
msgid "Bulletins papier enregistrés dans le système"
msgstr "Paper ballots recorded in the system"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:46
#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:97
msgid "Écart"
msgstr "Discrepancy"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:47
#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:98
msgid "Signé par"
msgstr "Signed by"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:48
#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:99
msgid "Remarques"
msgstr "Remarks"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:51
msgid ""
"Comptez les formulaires papier conservés par la commune et saisissez leur "
"nombre ; il est confronté au nombre de bulletins papier effectivement "
"enregistrés. La clôture reste bloquée tant que ce rapprochement n'est pas "
"signé."
msgstr ""
"Count the paper forms retained by the commune and enter their number; it is "
"checked against the number of paper ballots actually recorded. Closure stays "
"blocked until this reconciliation is signed."

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:56
msgid "Enregistrer le rapprochement"
msgstr "Record the reconciliation"

#: src/templates/backoffice/results_publish.html:59
msgid ""
"Rapprochement en attente de saisie par l'administrateur du scrutin, une fois "
